    AimAssistGUI.lua
    Place this as a LocalScript inside StarterPlayerScripts.

    Features:
    - Sleek animated GUI: smooth tweened toggles, hover effects, drop shadow,
      gradient accents, animated open/close for settings panel
    - Aim Helper toggle (F key or button)
    - Team Check toggle (skip teammates)
    - "Only while aiming" toggle (only assist while RMB held)
    - Settings panel with sliders: Radius, Cone Angle, Strength, Smoothness
